WEBVTT

00:13:59.376 --> 00:14:01.044
We can sit here for days.

00:14:02.629 --> 00:14:04.423
FO: So glad you warmed up.

00:14:05.257 --> 00:14:10.929
When you see your Grammys lined up,

00:14:10.971 --> 00:14:13.223
and they're all shiny and extraordinary,

00:14:13.223 --> 00:14:16.143
I'm not even going to name how many,
because every time I do,

00:14:16.143 --> 00:14:19.479
you get more and then this chat will date,

00:14:19.521 --> 00:14:23.650
so the many, multiple Grammys
that you have won,

00:14:23.692 --> 00:14:25.319
when you look at them,

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.570
Do you, "Whoo!"

00:14:26.612 --> 00:14:28.155
(Laughs)

00:14:28.196 --> 00:14:29.406
Does it feel good?

00:14:29.448 --> 00:14:30.741
AK: It feels good.